---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// JSON-LD ported verbatim from about/index.html — the live page currently
// has exactly one @type block, ProfessionalService (not the
// Person/Organization/BreadcrumbList combination the migration spec
// guessed might be there; verified against the actual source file).
const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'ProfessionalService',
    name: 'OpenRateLab',
    url: 'https://openratelab.com',
    email: 'hello@openratelab.com',
    description: 'Email marketing and copywriting agency for e-commerce and DTC brands. Specializing in Klaviyo flows and campaigns.',
    areaServed: 'Worldwide',
    availableLanguage: ['en'],
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | OpenRateLab - Email Marketing Specialists"
  description="We're an email marketing and copywriting agency focused entirely on revenue. Meet the team behind the copy that keeps performing."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
  ogImage="/images/team.jpg"
  ogImageWidth={1024}
  ogImageHeight={1024}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  isHomepage={false}
  activeNav="about"
>
  <section class="min-h-[60vh] flex flex-col justify-center px-8 md:px-16 py-20 relative overflow-hidden pixel-grid">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance uppercase block mb-4 tracking-[0.2em]">[ ABOUT US ]</span>
      <h1 class="font-display-xl-mobile text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-xl font-black uppercase leading-none mb-8">WE'RE OBSESSED<br/>WITH EMAIL REVENUE.</h1>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-muted-silver max-w-2xl italic border-l-2 border-accent-performance pl-8">OpenRateLab is a copywriting and email marketing agency built for brands that want email to perform, not just tick a box.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 md:py-40 px-8 md:px-16 bg-surface-primary border-t border-muted-silver/20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <img src="/images/team.jpg" alt="Uros Korene, founder of OpenRateLab email marketing agency" class="w-full h-[420px] md:h-[620px] object-cover border border-muted-silver/20" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy"/>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 mt-10 md:mt-0">
        <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance uppercase block mb-4">OUR STORY</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg uppercase mb-8 leading-none">BUILT BY MARKETERS<br/>WHO WERE TIRED OF AVERAGE</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-on-surface-warm">
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg">We started OpenRateLab because we kept seeing the same problem: brands with great products and healthy lists, leaving money in the inbox every single month. The copy was bland. The flows were incomplete. Nobody was thinking about the customer journey.</p>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg">We fix that. Our team writes email copy the way direct response writers have always written it, with every word accountable to a result. We apply those principles to Klaviyo, to ad platforms, to every touchpoint where words need to earn their keep.</p>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg">We work with a focused roster of e-commerce and DTC brands. We get deep into your brand, your customer, and your offer, and we write copy that reflects all three. No churn. No templates. No excuses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 border-l-2 border-accent-performance pl-6">
          <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-muted-silver uppercase block mb-2">DIRECT CONTACT</span>
          <a href="mailto:hello@openratelab.com" class="font-label-button text-on-surface-warm uppercase underline hover:text-accent-performance transition-colors">hello@openratelab.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="founder" class="py-24 md:py-40 px-8 md:px-16 bg-surface-primary border-t border-muted-silver/20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance uppercase block mb-4">THE FOUNDER</span>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg uppercase leading-none mb-8">UROS KORENE</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
        <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-warm">Uros Korene is the founder of OpenRateLab. He has been managing Klaviyo accounts and writing email copy for e-commerce and DTC brands since 2018, working across more than 22 active accounts and 2.5+ million email sends.</p>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-warm">Before building OpenRateLab, Uros worked inside high-volume DTC operations and saw the same pattern repeat: brands with strong products and healthy lists chronically underperforming on email because nobody had built the system or written the copy it deserved.</p>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-warm">He founded OpenRateLab to fix that: Klaviyo architecture that compounds and copy that earns its keep on every send.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9">
          <div class="border border-muted-silver/20 p-6 space-y-4">
            <div>
              <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance uppercase block mb-1">SPECIALTY</span>
              <span class="font-label-button text-on-surface-warm">Klaviyo Flows · Email Copy · DTC Retention</span>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-muted-silver/20 pt-4">
              <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance uppercase block mb-1">ACTIVE SINCE</span>
              <span class="font-label-button text-on-surface-warm">2018</span>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-muted-silver/20 pt-4">
              <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance uppercase block mb-1">CONTACT</span>
              <a href="mailto:hello@openratelab.com" class="font-label-button text-on-surface-warm uppercase underline hover:text-accent-performance transition-colors">hello@openratelab.com</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 md:py-40 px-8 md:px-16 bg-surface-secondary border-y border-muted-silver/20">
    <div class="mb-16 md:mb-20 text-center">
      <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance uppercase block mb-4">HOW WE WORK</span>
      <h2 class="font-display-xl-mobile text-display-xl-mobile uppercase">WHAT WE BELIEVE</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      <div class="value-card p-8 md:p-10 border border-muted-silver/20 bg-surface-primary transition-transform duration-300">
        <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance block mb-4">01 / COPY OVER CLAIMS</span>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-warm">We don't promise open rates. We write copy so good it earns them. Every line we write is accountable to results.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card p-8 md:p-10 border border-muted-silver/20 bg-surface-primary transition-transform duration-300">
        <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance block mb-4">02 / REVENUE, NOT VANITY</span>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-warm">Opens and clicks are nice. Revenue is what we track. We align every email to a business outcome before we write a single word.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card p-8 md:p-10 border border-muted-silver/20 bg-surface-primary transition-transform duration-300">
        <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance block mb-4">03 / BRAND VOICE, NOT TEMPLATES</span>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-warm">We work deep into your brand voice before we write. Your audience can tell the difference, and so can your revenue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card p-8 md:p-10 border border-muted-silver/20 bg-surface-primary transition-transform duration-300">
        <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance block mb-4">04 / STRATEGY FIRST</span>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-warm">Great copy in the wrong sequence is still wasted effort. We plan the full customer journey before we sit down to write.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 md:py-32 px-8 md:px-16 text-center pixel-grid border-b border-muted-silver/20">
    <span class="font-label-technical text-label-technical text-accent-performance uppercase mb-6 block">DEPLOYMENT_FINAL_PHASE</span>
    <h2 class="font-display-xl-mobile text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg uppercase mb-8 leading-tight">WANT TO SEE HOW<br/>WE WORK IN PRACTICE?</h2>
    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-muted-silver mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto italic">Reach out and tell us about your brand. We'll take it from there.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-4 md:gap-6">
      <a href="/#contact" class="inline-block bg-on-surface-warm text-surface-primary px-10 md:px-16 py-6 font-label-button uppercase text-lg tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-accent-performance hover:text-on-surface-warm transition-all duration-300">GET A FREE AUDIT</a>
      <a href="/#services" class="inline-block border border-muted-silver/30 text-on-surface-warm px-10 md:px-16 py-6 font-label-button uppercase text-lg tracking-[0.2em] hover:border-accent-performance hover:text-accent-performance transition-all duration-300">VIEW SERVICES</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Ported from about/index.html's inline <style> block. */
  .value-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
  }
</style>
